{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 15255299088054796990,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Simplify xrange()",
      "source_hash": 14614960645618233995,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "xrange() 간소화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 16636048076757055426,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652895Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP proposes to strip the ``xrange()`` object from some rarely used behavior like ``x[i:j]`` and ``x*n``.",
      "source_hash": 4188545128611800099,
      "context_hash": 1510901233106348306,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 ``xrange()`` 객체에서 ``x[i:j]`` 및 ``x*n``\\ 과 같은 일부 드물게 사용되는 동작을 제거할 것을 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652895Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Problem",
      "source_hash": 1660524370684533086,
      "context_hash": 9104936099492814055,
      "translation": "문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652896Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The ``xrange()`` function has one idiomatic use",
      "source_hash": 3252019961271720676,
      "context_hash": 16881879937835572203,
      "translation": "``xrange()`` 함수에는 관용적인 용도가 하나 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652896Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "However, the ``xrange()`` object has a bunch of rarely used behaviors that attempt to make it more sequence-like.",
      "source_hash": 14614226137689982980,
      "context_hash": 11120837009938621589,
      "translation": "그러나 ``xrange()`` 객체에는 시퀀스와 더 유사하게 만들려고 하는, 드물게 사용되는 동작이 많이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652896Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "These are so rarely used that historically they have has serious bugs (e.g. off-by-one errors) that went undetected for several releases.",
      "source_hash": 4988905844968986909,
      "context_hash": 7535674048335675475,
      "translation": "이러한 동작은 매우 드물게 사용되므로, 역사적으로 여러 릴리스 동안 발견되지 않은 심각한 버그(예: 오프바이원 오류)가 있었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "I claim that it's better to drop these unused features.",
      "source_hash": 4825074524189554441,
      "context_hash": 9194291030108848788,
      "translation": "저는 이러한 사용되지 않는 기능을 제거하는 편이 낫다고 주장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This will simplify the implementation, testing, and documentation, and reduce maintenance and code size.",
      "source_hash": 5313149259902280512,
      "context_hash": 2518220596804513099,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 구현, 테스트 및 문서화가 단순해지고, 유지 관리 부담과 코드 크기가 줄어듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Proposed Solution",
      "source_hash": 18265053091380772998,
      "context_hash": 1283307080206342443,
      "translation": "제안하는 해결책",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "I propose to strip the ``xrange()`` object to the bare minimum.",
      "source_hash": 16925294832957944925,
      "context_hash": 10602370554025700621,
      "translation": "``xrange()`` 객체를 최소한으로 축소할 것을 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The only retained sequence behaviors are ``x[i]``, ``len(x)``, and ``repr(x)``.",
      "source_hash": 1881451049541582464,
      "context_hash": 4336889193272126646,
      "translation": "유지되는 유일한 시퀀스 동작은 ``x[i]``, ``len(x)`` 및 ``repr(x)``\\ 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "In particular, these behaviors will be dropped:",
      "source_hash": 17237025009145752225,
      "context_hash": 6847349913345448740,
      "translation": "특히 다음 동작은 제거됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "``x[i:j]`` (slicing)",
      "source_hash": 12797314797736474127,
      "context_hash": 6946235910676604589,
      "translation": "``x[i:j]`` (슬라이싱)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652899Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "``x*n``, ``n*x`` (sequence-repeat)",
      "source_hash": 16755439959794399944,
      "context_hash": 17810034989000395277,
      "translation": "``x*n``, ``n*x`` (시퀀스 반복)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652899Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "``cmp(x1, x2)`` (comparisons)",
      "source_hash": 4022504240686925529,
      "context_hash": 4551549807687304875,
      "translation": "``cmp(x1, x2)`` (비교)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:01:19.652899Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "``i in x`` (containment test)",
      "source_hash": 16650115546524897256,
      "context_hash": 9526807489256791780,
      "translation": "``i in x`` (포함 검사)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528885Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "``x.tolist()`` method",
      "source_hash": 10130935379222283103,
      "context_hash": 14777221015977962191,
      "translation": "``x.tolist()`` 메서드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528887Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "``x.start``, ``x.stop``, ``x.step`` attributes",
      "source_hash": 4516314523488189559,
      "context_hash": 4169457558663296136,
      "translation": "``x.start``, ``x.stop``, ``x.step`` 속성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "I also propose to change the signature of the ``PyRange_New()`` C API to remove the 4th argument (the repetition count).",
      "source_hash": 9528724160846802752,
      "context_hash": 13923195914445938636,
      "translation": "저는 또한 ``PyRange_New()`` C API의 시그니처를 변경하여 네 번째 인자(반복 횟수)를 제거할 것을 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "By implementing a custom iterator type, we could speed up the common use, but this is optional (the default sequence iterator does just fine).",
      "source_hash": 16359454085722111159,
      "context_hash": 15386088997961766930,
      "translation": "사용자 정의 이터레이터 타입을 구현하면 일반적인 사용에서 속도를 높일 수 있지만, 이는 선택 사항입니다(기본 시퀀스 이터레이터로도 충분합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "iterator": "이터레이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Scope",
      "source_hash": 18262138923952726113,
      "context_hash": 9643572874594875799,
      "translation": "범위",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP affects the ``xrange()`` built-in function and the ``PyRange_New()`` C API.",
      "source_hash": 6231731097949897282,
      "context_hash": 15240517749691862287,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 ``xrange()`` 내장 함수와 ``PyRange_New()`` C API에 영향을 미칩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Risks",
      "source_hash": 11522566933757613011,
      "context_hash": 4469206963232805502,
      "translation": "위험",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Somebody's code could be relying on the extended code, and this code would break.",
      "source_hash": 15741640180538756806,
      "context_hash": 3872473007427680412,
      "translation": "누군가의 코드가 확장된 코드에 의존하고 있을 수 있으며, 이 경우 해당 코드는 깨질 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528891Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "However, given that historically bugs in the extended code have gone undetected for so long, it's unlikely that much code is affected.",
      "source_hash": 3347284847621037397,
      "context_hash": 6335780308069744441,
      "translation": "하지만 역사적으로 확장된 코드의 버그가 그렇게 오랫동안 발견되지 않았던 것을 고려하면, 영향을 받는 코드가 많지는 않을 것 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528892Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Transition",
      "source_hash": 1505145712585490624,
      "context_hash": 11126986921507160393,
      "translation": "전환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528892Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For backwards compatibility, the existing functionality will still be present in Python 2.2, but will trigger a warning.",
      "source_hash": 1289819284946102867,
      "context_hash": 1482134833852327097,
      "translation": "하위 호환성을 위해 기존 기능은 Python 2.2에서도 여전히 존재하겠지만, 경고를 발생시킬 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528893Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A year after Python 2.2 final is released (probably in 2.4) the functionality will be ripped out.",
      "source_hash": 16832418587467351439,
      "context_hash": 5551674928930898822,
      "translation": "Python 2.2 최종판이 릴리스된 지 1년 후(아마도 2.4에서) 해당 기능은 제거될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:36.528893Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}